{"lang": "zh_TW", "eventid": "act48side", "eventName": "雅賽努斯復仇記", "entryType": "ACTIVITY", "storyCode": "ME-4", "avgTag": "行動前", "storyName": "失手", "storyInfo": "第一神殿重建現場之外，運河上的擺渡人贊索斯盯上了緹緹，以及她帶來雅賽努斯的文物。\n", "storyList": [{"id": 0, "prop": "HEADER", "attributes": {"key": "title_test", "is_skippable": "true", "fit_mode": "BLACK_MASK"}}, {"id": 1, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "duration": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 2, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 3, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 4, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 5, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "69_g14_luxuriousroom", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 6, "prop": "PlayMusic", "attributes": {"key": "$normal_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 7, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "duration": 1.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 8, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 9, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#18$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 10, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 11, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 12, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#18$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 13, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "“於是阿加門最溫柔的英雄，史詩的吟唱者克瑞斯拉，將她的豎琴掛在月桂的樹梢上；”", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#18$1"}, {"id": 14, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "“那把琴——它的琴身來自荷謨伊高山中聳立的杉樹，它的琴弦取自阿涅斯平原上勇猛馱獸的肚腸；”", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#18$1"}, {"id": 15, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "“當它鳴響，萬物便在英雄的國度歌唱，自由地，飄向遠方。”", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#18$1"}, {"id": 16, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#10$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 17, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "緹緹，難怪當時你看到克瑞斯拉雕像落成，就想到了要把文物交換儀式的地點定在神殿廣場上。", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#10$1"}, {"id": 18, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "原來你帶來交換的，就是克瑞斯拉當初使用過的豎琴，還是曾擺放在舊雅賽努斯城第一神殿中的那一把？", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#10$1"}, {"id": 19, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 20, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "是的！", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2"}, {"id": 21, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "傳說克瑞斯拉在荷謨伊山下聽到群山講述的故事，深受鼓舞。而後她便用山岩與杉樹作為材料，製作了一把巨大的豎琴。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2"}, {"id": 22, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#10$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 23, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那是一把獲得了祝福的琴，傳聞只有在重要的日子，或是由如同克瑞斯拉般的英雄撥動琴弦，它才會將清越的琴聲送進人們的心裡。", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#10$1"}, {"id": 24, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不過，薩爾貢人攻入舊雅賽努斯城後，城中一片混亂，第一神殿也隨之被毀。", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#10$1"}, {"id": 25, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "豎琴似乎也為這悲痛的一幕而啞然，自此之後不再發聲，後來更是不知所終。", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#10$1"}, {"id": 26, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 27, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但幸運的是，赫里帕夏在他的收藏中找到了它。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2"}, {"id": 28, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "雖然不知道琴是怎麼去薩爾貢的——我想可能是當時某個薩爾貢士兵將它從舊雅賽努斯盜走，轉手賣給了帕夏的祖先。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2"}, {"id": 29, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#20$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 30, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "唔，按年分推算，現在雅賽努斯城內，已無人親眼見過當年還在原址的那把豎琴。", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#20$1"}, {"id": 31, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "或許只有少數熟諳典籍的祭司，或是卡珊卓拉那種能與眾英雄對話的天賦者，才對這把琴有所瞭解。", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#20$1"}, {"id": 32, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "這把豎琴仍能發聲？", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#20$1"}, {"id": 33, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 34, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "可以。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2"}, {"id": 35, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "對藏品進行檢測時，我們確認過琴弦，雖有一定程度的老化，但仍能奏響。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2"}, {"id": 36, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#16$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 37, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "原來如此，看來傳說中琴因戰亂而沉默，或許只是一個米諾斯故事裡慣用的比喻……", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#16$1"}, {"id": 38, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 39, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 40, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 41, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 42, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "69_g5_athenusalley", "screenadapt": "coverall", "block": "true"}}, {"id": 43, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 44, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 45, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 46, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2074_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 47, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "怎麼渡口的人還沒來？", "name": "旅店老闆"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2074_1#1$1"}, {"id": 48, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我們旅店付了這麼高的租金開在河道旁邊，不就是為了以最快的速度拿到最新鮮的鱗獲嘛。", "name": "旅店老闆"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2074_1#1$1"}, {"id": 49, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 50, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 51, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_gen_walk_n"}}, {"id": 52, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#1$1", "duration": 1.5}}, {"id": 53, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 54, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "老闆，食材到了。", "name": "呂刻伊昂"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2069_1#1$1"}, {"id": 55, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2074_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 56, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "哎喲，你們終於來了！今天的食材再不送來，就來不及招待使節團的貴客了……", "name": "旅店老闆"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2074_1#1$1"}, {"id": 57, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 58, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "要我幫您卸貨嗎？", "name": "呂刻伊昂"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2069_1#1$1"}, {"id": 59, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2074_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 60, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "等等，船今天怎麼停得這麼遠？等一下卸貨的時候，不就會掉進水裡了嘛。", "name": "旅店老闆"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2074_1#1$1"}, {"id": 61, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "先生，麻煩你再把貨船往前開一點，離廚房越近越好。", "name": "旅店老闆"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2074_1#1$1"}, {"id": 62, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#3$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 63, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "呂刻伊昂"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2069_1#3$1"}, {"id": 64, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "好。", "name": "呂刻伊昂"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2069_1#3$1"}, {"id": 65, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2074_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 66, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "多謝多謝。不過今天來送貨的怎麼是你？平常不都是贊索斯負責的嗎？", "name": "旅店老闆"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2074_1#1$1"}, {"id": 67, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 68, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "老師有點事要處理，抱歉。", "name": "呂刻伊昂"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2069_1#1$1"}, {"id": 69, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2074_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 70, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "好說好說，反正食材也送到了，不影響廚房開工就好。", "name": "旅店老闆"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2074_1#1$1"}, {"id": 71, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你跟著贊索斯也有兩三年了吧？他做事嚴謹，這麼安排一定有他的道理，我完全放心。", "name": "旅店老闆"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2074_1#1$1"}, {"id": 72, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 73, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "呂刻伊昂"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2069_1#1$1"}, {"id": 74, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 75, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 76, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 77, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 78, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "69_g14_luxuriousroom", "screenadapt": "coverall", "block": "true"}}, {"id": 79, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 80, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#1$1", "focus": "all"}}, {"id": 81, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#1$2", "focus": "all"}}, {"id": 82, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 83, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 84, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#11$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 85, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不好意思啊，帕拉斯。今天神殿的所有人都在趕工，我實在沒辦法從搬運隊裡抽幾個幫手出來。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#11$2"}, {"id": 86, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "作為交換儀式的一環，我想提前把琴放去第一神殿裡，看看能不能和克瑞斯拉雕像配對上。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#11$2"}, {"id": 87, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不過這麼重的一把豎琴，我本來應該找一個高大的工匠來幫忙搬運，僅憑我們兩個……", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#11$2"}, {"id": 88, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#11$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 89, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "欸，此話差矣。據史料記載，克瑞斯拉本人身材也並不高大，站在豎琴旁會呈現出極大的反差。", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#11$1"}, {"id": 90, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "說不定我一個人就夠了——", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#11$1"}, {"id": 91, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 92, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "posfrom": "0,0", "posto": "-50,-30", "duration": 1.5, "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 93, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.5}}, {"id": 94, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "posfrom": "-50,-30", "posto": "-45,-30", "duration": 2.5, "block": "true", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 95, "prop": "CameraShake", "attributes": {"duration": 2.5, "xstrength": 0.0, "ystrength": 5.0, "vibrato": 10.0, "randomness": 10.0, "fadeout": "false", "block": "true"}}, {"id": 96, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_dragheavybox"}}, {"id": 97, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "action": "shake", "random": "true", "power": 50.0, "times": 3.0, "duration": 0.8, "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 98, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 99, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#9$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 100, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "呼……這個木箱裡面是灌鉛了嗎，怎麼這麼重？", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#9$1"}, {"id": 101, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 102, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "posfrom": "-50,-30", "posto": "0,0", "duration": 1.5}}, {"id": 103, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.5}}, {"id": 104, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 105, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "哈哈……我們從古道進入雅賽努斯，路途顛簸，而文物交換事關重大，不能有任何閃失。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2"}, {"id": 106, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "出發之前我特地找了我的博物館的庫房管理員，準備了既能防水避火，又能抗震減壓的包裝材料，貨物的重量自然也就翻倍了。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2"}, {"id": 107, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#6$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 108, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不過好處是，哪怕是大樓倒塌或者突發地震，文物都能毫髮無傷！", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#6$2"}, {"id": 109, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#10$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 110, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "看得出來，你對自己的博物館和藏品都很用心。", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#10$1"}, {"id": 111, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#10$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 112, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "因為我對什麼都蠻感興趣的，所以乾脆去哥倫比亞讀了博物館學，回薩爾貢之後就順勢進了博物館。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#10$2"}, {"id": 113, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不過，我的父親早逝，家族沒落……說實話，到現在我都不是很清楚，為什麼我會被帕夏選為薩爾貢使節團的大使……", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#10$2"}, {"id": 114, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 115, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但事已至此，就得認真對待才行！", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2"}, {"id": 116, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 117, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "緹緹，我有沒有說過，你——", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#1$1"}, {"id": 118, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 119, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 120, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$smallearthquake"}}, {"id": 121, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.5}}, {"id": 122, "prop": "bgeffect", "attributes": {"name": "$eb_dust_01", "layer": 1.0}}, {"id": 123, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#8$1", "focus": "all"}}, {"id": 124, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#12$2", "focus": "all"}}, {"id": 125, "prop": "CameraShake", "attributes": {"duration": 3.5, "xstrength": 10.0, "ystrength": 10.0, "vibrato": 30.0, "randomness": 90.0, "fadeout": "true", "block": "false"}}, {"id": 126, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.3}}, {"id": 127, "prop": "bgeffect", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 128, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "posfrom": "0,0", "posto": "240,0", "duration": 0.5, "focus": "all"}}, {"id": 129, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.3}}, {"id": 130, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "posfrom": "0,0", "posto": "40,0", "duration": 0.5, "focus": "all"}}, {"id": 131, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_gen_explo_n", "volume": 0.3}}, {"id": 132, "prop": "CameraShake", "attributes": {"duration": 3.0, "fadeout": "true", "xstrength": 16.0, "ystrength": 22.0, "vibrato": 30.0, "randomness": 90.0, "block": "false"}}, {"id": 133, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 3.0}}, {"id": 134, "prop": "PlayMusic", "attributes": {"intro": "$nervous_intro", "key": "$nervous_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 135, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#17$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 136, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "怎麼回事？！緹緹，你還好嗎！", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#17$1"}, {"id": 137, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 138, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "posfrom": "240,0", "posto": "0,0", "duration": 2.5, "focus": "all"}}, {"id": 139, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.3}}, {"id": 140, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "posfrom": "40,0", "posto": "0,0", "duration": 2.0, "focus": "all"}}, {"id": 141, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 3.0}}, {"id": 142, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#12$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 143, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "放心，豎琴沒有問題！", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#12$2"}, {"id": 144, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#19$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 145, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我問的是你！", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#19$1"}, {"id": 146, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#11$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 147, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "說地震就地震了……還好文物的防護工作做得很完美。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#11$2"}, {"id": 148, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "樓下發生了什麼事？怎麼這麼吵？", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#11$2"}, {"id": 149, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#20$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 150, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "唔，好像是渡口來的船一頭撞進了旅店廚房？", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#20$1"}, {"id": 151, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 152, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 153, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 154, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 155, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "69_g5_athenusalley", "screenadapt": "coverall", "block": "true"}}, {"id": 156, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 157, "prop": "bgeffect", "attributes": {"name": "$eb_smoke_01", "layer": 1.0}}, {"id": 158, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_churchfire", "volume": 0.0, "loop": "true", "channel": "c"}}, {"id": 159, "prop": "SoundVolume", "attributes": {"volume": 1.0, "channel": "c", "fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 160, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 161, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 162, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_earthfissure"}}, {"id": 163, "prop": "CameraShake", "attributes": {"duration": 3.0, "xstrength": 10.0, "ystrength": 10.0, "vibrato": 30.0, "randomness": 90.0, "fadeout": "true", "block": "false"}}, {"id": 164, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 3.0}}, {"id": 165, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "完了……全完了！", "name": "哀嘆的男聲"}}, {"id": 166, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你到底會不會開船！五公尺遠的距離你揚什麼帆？今天這種大風天，船的速度比信使荷邁斯的腳程還快！", "name": "哀嘆的男聲"}}, {"id": 167, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "您說船離廚房越近越好。", "name": "淡定的男聲"}}, {"id": 168, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "哀嘆的男聲"}}, {"id": 169, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "它們現在都負距離接觸了！", "name": "哀嘆的男聲"}}, {"id": 170, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 171, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$rungeneral"}}, {"id": 172, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#9$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 173, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.5}}, {"id": 174, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "借過，都借過一下。", "name": "赫卡德墨"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2070_1#9$1"}, {"id": 175, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "治安官已經在疏散人群了，大家不要聚在這裡圍觀。我先來瞭解一下情況，到底發生什麼了——", "name": "赫卡德墨"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2070_1#9$1"}, {"id": 176, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#11$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 177, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "呂刻伊昂？", "name": "赫卡德墨"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2070_1#11$1"}, {"id": 178, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#10$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 179, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "呂刻伊昂"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2069_1#10$1"}, {"id": 180, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2074_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 181, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "執筆人先生，請你一定要為我做主啊！", "name": "旅店老闆"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2074_1#1$1"}, {"id": 182, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我只是想讓運送食材的貨船離廚房更近一點，沒想到這個小子直接把我的廚房撞爛了……", "name": "旅店老闆"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2074_1#1$1"}, {"id": 183, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#10$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 184, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "真的很對不起，我……並不會開船。", "name": "呂刻伊昂"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2069_1#10$1"}, {"id": 185, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2074_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 186, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你跟著贊索斯那麼久了，每天都待在渡口，到現在連開船都不會？騙誰啊！", "name": "旅店老闆"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2074_1#1$1"}, {"id": 187, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#4$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 188, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "理論知識，不能充分指導實踐。", "name": "呂刻伊昂"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2069_1#4$1"}, {"id": 189, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2074_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 190, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你——！", "name": "旅店老闆"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2074_1#1$1"}, {"id": 191, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#5$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 192, "prop": "CameraShake", "attributes": {"duration": 0.5, "xstrength": 10.0, "ystrength": 10.0, "vibrato": 30.0, "randomness": 90.0, "fadeout": "true", "block": "false"}}, {"id": 193, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "好了！", "name": "赫卡德墨"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2070_1#5$1"}, {"id": 194, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#8$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 195, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我可以作證，還在祭司學院念書的時候，他的方程式戰車競技課考試就沒及格過。", "name": "赫卡德墨"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2070_1#8$1"}, {"id": 196, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2074_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 197, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那、那這麼大的停泊標誌也沒看到嗎？船頭是直接越過欄杆撞進來的啊！", "name": "旅店老闆"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2074_1#1$1"}, {"id": 198, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#11$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 199, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "沒看到……？", "name": "赫卡德墨"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2070_1#11$1"}, {"id": 200, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "（源石感染已經蔓延到了他的視覺中樞……所以那天萊娜小姐才上門診療？！）", "name": "赫卡德墨"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2070_1#11$1"}, {"id": 201, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "呂刻伊昂……", "name": "赫卡德墨"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2070_1#11$1"}, {"id": 202, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#10$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 203, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……你這是什麼表情，好像我馬上就快死——", "name": "呂刻伊昂"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2069_1#10$1"}, {"id": 204, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#11$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 205, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "呸呸呸！就算這是事實……不、不准你說這樣的話！", "name": "赫卡德墨"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2070_1#11$1"}, {"id": 206, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2074_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 207, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "呃，執筆人先生，我知道你們是同學，但能不能先秉公幫我處理廚房的損失啊。", "name": "旅店老闆"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2074_1#1$1"}, {"id": 208, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#6$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 209, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "拿著。", "name": "赫卡德墨"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2070_1#6$1"}, {"id": 210, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2074_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 211, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "欸？這是您的錢袋？", "name": "旅店老闆"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2074_1#1$1"}, {"id": 212, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#6$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 213, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "要多少自己拿，我來幫他賠。", "name": "赫卡德墨"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2070_1#6$1"}, {"id": 214, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 215, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "誰叫你幫我賠錢啊？", "name": "呂刻伊昂"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2069_1#1$1"}, {"id": 216, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#8$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 217, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你從祭司學院離開之後，也沒有一份正經工作。雖然吃住由贊索斯先生負責，但也存不了多少錢吧。", "name": "赫卡德墨"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2070_1#8$1"}, {"id": 218, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#11$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 219, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不用擔心這筆賠款，你的錢得拿去治病。別忘了，你還欠我一場辯論。", "name": "赫卡德墨"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2070_1#11$1"}, {"id": 220, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#10$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 221, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不是，我真的沒事……咳咳……", "name": "呂刻伊昂"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2069_1#10$1"}, {"id": 222, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#4$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 223, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "咳嗽……難道是急性發作？醫生呢！醫生在哪裡？", "name": "赫卡德墨"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2070_1#4$1"}, {"id": 224, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2069_1#9$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 225, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "閉嘴，我只是被煙嗆到了！理事官的執筆人先生，你還是先去找人救火吧。", "name": "呂刻伊昂"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2069_1#9$1"}, {"id": 226, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 227, "prop": "stopsound", "attributes": {"channel": "c", "fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 228, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 229, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 230, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 231, "prop": "bgeffect", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 232, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "69_g14_luxuriousroom", "screenadapt": "coverall", "block": "true"}}, {"id": 233, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#16$1", "focus": "all"}}, {"id": 234, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#12$2", "focus": "all"}}, {"id": 235, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 236, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 237, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 238, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#16$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 239, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "火勢變大了，看來船頭不巧撞在了廚房的火爐上……咳咳，煙霧怎麼這麼濃？", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#16$1"}, {"id": 240, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#12$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 241, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我們得先離開室內去空曠的地方，不然吸入太多煙塵就危險了。但這把琴……", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#12$2"}, {"id": 242, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 243, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "豎琴的防護措施做得很好，我看樓下已經有治安官在組織滅火了，火勢不會蔓延上來，十幾分鐘內應該就能控制住了。", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#1$1"}, {"id": 244, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#20$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 245, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "而且，這裡上下的樓梯太窄了，搬運豎琴說不定會擋住其他人的撤離路線。再加上，咳咳——", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#20$1"}, {"id": 246, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#12$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 247, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "帕拉斯你還好嗎……？", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#12$2"}, {"id": 248, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#11$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 249, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你說得對，我們得先離開這裡，等煙一散開就回來。走吧。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#11$2"}, {"id": 250, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 251, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$rungeneral"}}, {"id": 252, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "posfrom": "0,0", "posto": "200,0", "afrom": 1.0, "ato": 0.0, "duration": 1.5}}, {"id": 253, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "posfrom": "0,0", "posto": "200,0", "afrom": 1.0, "ato": 0.0, "duration": 1.5}}, {"id": 254, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.5}}, {"id": 255, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 256, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 257, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 258, "prop": "bgeffect", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 259, "prop": "bgeffect", "attributes": {"name": "$eb_smoke_01", "layer": 1.0}}, {"id": 260, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "69_g5_athenusalley", "screenadapt": "coverall", "block": "true"}}, {"id": 261, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_churchfire", "volume": 0.0, "loop": "true", "channel": "c"}}, {"id": 262, "prop": "SoundVolume", "attributes": {"volume": 1.0, "channel": "c", "fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 263, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 264, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_crwddiscuss_outside", "loop": "true", "channel": "1"}}, {"id": 265, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 266, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 267, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "失火了？完了，我房間裡的行李該怎麼辦啊！", "name": "慌張的客人"}}, {"id": 268, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2088_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 269, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "別擔心，起火點在一樓廚房，不會殃及樓上的客房，等火完全熄滅、濃煙散去就好。", "name": "治安官"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2088_1#1$1"}, {"id": 270, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "大家不要推擠、不要堵在旅店門口，樓上還有客人沒有下來——", "name": "治安官"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2088_1#1$1"}, {"id": 271, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "欸，那邊那位先生，別急著現在進去啊。", "name": "治安官"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2088_1#1$1"}, {"id": 272, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 273, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 274, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "？？？"}}, {"id": 275, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 276, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "style": "slider", "inverse": "true", "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 277, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 278, "prop": "bgeffect", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 279, "prop": "stopsound", "attributes": {"channel": "c", "fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 280, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#20$1"}}, {"id": 281, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#12$2"}}, {"id": 282, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 283, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "style": "slider", "inverse": "true", "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 284, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#12$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 285, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "怎麼樣帕拉斯，好一點了嗎？", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#12$2"}, {"id": 286, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#20$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 287, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "沒事，只是被濃煙嗆到了。", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#20$1"}, {"id": 288, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 289, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "再過十幾分鐘我們應該就能回到房間了，到時候我幫你一起把琴搬到第一神殿去，以免旅店再出事。", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#1$1"}, {"id": 290, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 291, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "謝謝。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2"}, {"id": 292, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 293, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_clothmovement"}}, {"id": 294, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "posfrom": "0,0", "posto": "50,0", "duration": 0.5}}, {"id": 295, "prop": "CameraShake", "attributes": {"duration": 0.5, "xstrength": 10.0, "ystrength": 10.0, "vibrato": 30.0, "randomness": 90.0, "fadeout": "true", "block": "false"}}, {"id": 296, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 297, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#5$2", "focus": "all"}}, {"id": 298, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.5}}, {"id": 299, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "posfrom": "50,0", "posto": "0,0", "duration": 1.5}}, {"id": 300, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 301, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#5$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 302, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "啊，這裡人太多了，抱歉。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#5$2"}, {"id": 303, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 304, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#5$2", "focus": "none"}}, {"id": 305, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "？？？"}}, {"id": 306, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 307, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_gen_walk_n"}}, {"id": 308, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#5$2", "focus": "none"}}, {"id": 309, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 310, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#5$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 311, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "帕拉斯，你看到剛剛那個人了嗎？好像有點眼熟？", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#5$2"}, {"id": 312, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 313, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "嗯？你說誰？", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#1$1"}, {"id": 314, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#1$1", "focus": "none"}}, {"id": 315, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "喂，你聽說了沒？船撞上廚房這件事是渡口的那個小子搞的，沒想到人看起來很聰明，結果開船笨手笨腳的。", "name": "好事的人"}}, {"id": 316, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "贊索斯呢？貨平常不都是他送的？", "name": "無聊的人"}}, {"id": 317, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不知道啊，可能是太忙來不了吧。不過放任手下不懂事的小子惹出事端，也不像是他的做事風格。", "name": "好事的人"}}, {"id": 318, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "確實。", "name": "無聊的人"}}, {"id": 319, "prop": "stopsound", "attributes": {"channel": "1", "fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 320, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#1$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 321, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……我想起來了，剛剛撞到我的人是渡口的贊索斯先生。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#1$2"}, {"id": 322, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#9$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 323, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "贊索斯？你是不是認錯了？", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#9$1"}, {"id": 324, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "要是有空來旅店，為什麼要讓自己不熟悉駕駛的徒弟掌舵，還撞壞了廚房？等等……", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#9$1"}, {"id": 325, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#15$2", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 326, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我有種不好的預感。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#15$2"}, {"id": 327, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#16$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 328, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我也是。", "name": "帕拉斯"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#16$1"}, {"id": 329, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 330, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 331, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 332, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 333, "prop": "Image", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 334, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": ""}}], "OPTIONTRACE": true}